        "description": "Full-text search over live blocks. Each hit carries a signed receipt (pass it to verify() before relying on it later) and authority: can_act | inspect_only | never_act with a reason; only can_act is safe to act on unchecked. absence says what was and was not searched: an empty result is not proof of absence unless verdict is absent_in_searched. Pass cursor: hits you already read this session rank lower.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "properties": {
