        "description": "Re-check recall() receipts (receipt / receipt_id, or up to 100 as receipts / receipt_ids) against the store (signature, re-hashed block text, chain position, supersession): VERIFIED | SUPERSEDED (see current_block_id) | TOMBSTONED | STALE_SOURCE | UNVERIFIED, with a reason. Fail-closed: with a batch, the top-level result is the first one not VERIFIED and results[] has each in input order.",
